# Enforce LF line endings repo-wide. Several files drifted to CRLF when
# authored on Windows (build.yml, update-pr-branches.yml, dependabot.yml);
# this pins every text file to LF so checkout and commit never reintroduce
# CRLF. No .gitignore here by design - that file is intentionally empty and
# acts as a tripwire (see AGENTS.md).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must not be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.so binary
*.whl binary